  "comments": "The 1986 strike was not issued for circulation and only issued as part of the Annual Coin Sets in both Brilliant Uncirculated &amp; Proof versions.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse varieties:</span><br /><br />\r\nAn obverse die design change occurred part way through 1992.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1985-1992</span> slightly smaller portrait;<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1992-1997</span> slightly larger portrait;<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5b689949f17ca.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5b689949f17ca.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5b68997568ab7.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5b68997568ab7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5b68999c8c729.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5b68999c8c729.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nInformation has been received to suggest that 1992 BU and Proof sets bear the large portrait but this is yet to be confirmed.<br /><br />\r\n1997 has small varieties in the design of the portrait.",
